    "detailedExplanationEn": "🎯 Correct Answer: Option A (\"Special promotion in aisle 6 in Calgary with the 3rd item at half price\")\n\n• Acoustic Evidence:\nThe audio announcement states: \"Store announcement: Special offer in aisle 6, 3rd item at half price.\".\nOption A (\"Special promotion in aisle 6 in Calgary with the 3rd item at half price\") accurately reflects the essential information conveyed in the recording.\n\n• Detailed Distractor Breakdown (Incorrect Options):\n  - Option A (\"Special promotion in aisle 6 in Calgary with the 3rd item at half price\") [CORRECT]: Accurately reflects the factual information confirmed in the official announcement.\n  - Option B (\"Exceptional closure of the Calgary store due to construction work\") [INCORRECT - OPERATIONAL OR NUMERICAL DISTRACTOR TRAP]: Introduces a false lead (\"Exceptional closure of the Calgary store due to construction work\") contradicting the exact facts stated in the audio clip.\n  - Option C (\"Arrival of new eco-friendly cleaning products in aisle 6\") [INCORRECT - OPERATIONAL OR NUMERICAL DISTRACTOR TRAP]: Introduces a false lead (\"Arrival of new eco-friendly cleaning products in aisle 6\") contradicting the exact facts stated in the audio clip.\n  - Option D (\"Free loyalty card distribution at the reception of the Calgary store\") [INCORRECT - OPERATIONAL OR NUMERICAL DISTRACTOR TRAP]: Introduces a false lead (\"Free loyalty card distribution at the reception of the Calgary store\") contradicting the exact facts stated in the audio clip.",
    "readingCoach": "💡 Stratégie A1 (Écoute Ciblée - Annonce Publique) : Concentrez-vous sur l'annonceur et l'objet immédiat de la consigne (ex: numéro de voie et heure de départ, rayon de la promotion, ou prévisions météorologiques). Notez mentalement les repères clés dès la première écoute pour repérer la réponse exacte.",
