    "detailedExplanationEn": "🎯 Correct Answer: Option A (\"Reminder of follow-up medical appointment in Sherbrooke scheduled for mardi à 15h30\")\n\n• Acoustic Evidence:\nIn response to \"Why is the person leaving this phone message?\", the voicemail states: \"Hello, medical office calling. Your follow-up appointment is Tuesday at 15:30.\".\nOption A (\"Reminder of follow-up medical appointment in Sherbrooke scheduled for mardi à 15h30\") accurately reflects the verified purpose in the recording.\n\n• Detailed Distractor Breakdown (Incorrect Options):\n  - Option A (\"Reminder of follow-up medical appointment in Sherbrooke scheduled for mardi à 15h30\") [CORRECT]: Accurately reflects the central purpose or instruction communicated by the caller.\n  - Option B (\"Definitive cancellation of Dr. Tremblay's medical consultation\") [INCORRECT - SECONDARY DETAIL OR EXTRAPOLATION TRAP]: Focuses on a peripheral detail (\"Definitive cancellation of Dr. Tremblay's medical consultation\") rather than the primary purpose of the call.\n  - Option C (\"Address change of local medical clinic in Sherbrooke\") [INCORRECT - SECONDARY DETAIL OR EXTRAPOLATION TRAP]: Focuses on a peripheral detail (\"Address change of local medical clinic in Sherbrooke\") rather than the primary purpose of the call.\n  - Option D (\"Request to send medical analysis results by postal mail\") [INCORRECT - SECONDARY DETAIL OR EXTRAPOLATION TRAP]: Focuses on a peripheral detail (\"Request to send medical analysis results by postal mail\") rather than the primary purpose of the call.",
